  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Dancing snow falls as large round snowflakes, pure white and about the size of an adult’s palm. It is a rank six immortal material formed naturally. It does not melt while the temperature stays at a certain level, and it always stays afloat: even after landing, it flies upward again.",
      "chapters": [
        1462
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "afloat-snowflakes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xue Er brings dancing snow among snowman betrothal gifts stored in Mini Northern Plains. It is the second largest share after snow lotus essence. The batch can feed a rank six wisdom path Immortal Gu four to five times, so Fang Yuan need not buy dancing snow from treasure yellow heaven for that use.",
